    "name": "Chosen War",
    "steam_appid": 3169180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/00c329c9d2a64957119b4f59b9a2a9d3.avif?t=1751533896\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chosen War&quot; is a strategic roguelike game where you build a troop list for battles. You will take on the role of the Divine Chosen One, assembling and leading your army to explore various islands. Through careful troop deployment, you engage in battles against enemies. By using the skills of the Divine Chosen One and simple operations on the army, you strive to defeat the foes. After passing different islands, you'll receive various rewards. It could be an upgrade to your troops, the liberation and incorporation of imprisoned slaves into your army, or the rich treasures hidden under the Italian divine secrets. Ultimately, you'll battle against the evil High Priest to achieve the final victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Forks in the Road</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the islands are shrouded in mist. Only the islands you've visited reveal the surrounding conditions. When you encounter a fork in the road, which path leads to the island of the Mad Priest? If you choose the wrong one, do you have enough rations to get back on the right track? Will you use items, your wits, or perhaps courage to turn the situation around?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Troop Enhancements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/71613635222e4a844b9b4bf4f536b853.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/71613635222e4a844b9b4bf4f536b853.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/71613635222e4a844b9b4bf4f536b853.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step onto a mysterious island and after a fierce battle, the God of Spaghetti will bestow upon you the rewards you've earned. You can choose one of three troop enhancements. When the same troop type obtains its third enhancement, a qualitative </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change occurs. Of course, the God of Spaghetti knows you might not be satisfied with the enhancements presented, so it gives you a chance to refresh them. But why does it cost gold coins? Does even the god need gold coins?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Cunning Merchant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/79fc41ac63997fbe53b979b218812efc.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/79fc41ac63997fbe53b979b218812efc.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/79fc41ac63997fbe53b979b218812efc.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the shop island, there is a cunning merchant who resides there permanently. He seems to possess powerful magic but only has his eyes on the gold coins in your hands. You can purchase various magic items and troops from him. Even better, for just some gold coins, you can immediately master some powerful skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Altar of Miracles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/96b3b620a97e01ecb292e9bc31b13dba.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/96b3b620a97e01ecb292e9bc31b13dba.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/96b3b620a97e01ecb292e9bc31b13dba.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fallen warriors will become heroic spirits. The God of Spaghetti has set up resurrection altars imbued with miraculous power, along with a coin - slot, on some islands. With just a few gold coins, you can resurrect your heroic spirits. However, the newly - resurrected warriors seem a bit weak. Of course, even if you don't spend the gold coins, the great God of Spaghetti will ensure that your surviving army benefits from the miracle's curative effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Imprisoned Slaves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/5362d800ae1332b89dc2d1b65fa7c384.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/5362d800ae1332b89dc2d1b65fa7c384.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/5362d800ae1332b89dc2d1b65fa7c384.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors of various races are imprisoned in a gloomy jail by the enemies on the island. Defeat the enemies, break the prison, rescue these warriors, and bring them under your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Island Transitions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/cb1337f8534b03d1b161c24e49efccbd.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/cb1337f8534b03d1b161c24e49efccbd.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/cb1337f8534b03d1b161c24e49efccbd.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides using your small boat to slide to other islands, you can also teleport from one sugar - triangle island crackling with lightning to another such island. This allows you to travel long distances without consuming rations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abundant Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/f0482cf00c61d8b5a8ddaefe5a79cf67.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/f0482cf00c61d8b5a8ddaefe5a79cf67.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/f0482cf00c61d8b5a8ddaefe5a79cf67.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The God of Spaghetti has hidden abundant treasures on some islands. Of course, you're not the only one attracted by the treasures. The enemies have also stationed stronger troops to guard the treasures. Eliminate them and seize the treasures!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A One - of - a - Kind Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of your adventures is unique. You'll face randomly - generated enemies, routes, rewards, etc. Confront unknown challenges, explore routes to the final island, and make your choices!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/00c329c9d2a64957119b4f59b9a2a9d3.avif?t=1751533896\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.poster.avif?t=1751533896\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.webm?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169180/extras/60add319d4dd65f756076dfc4b1ac9fe.mp4?t=1751533896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chosen War&quot; is a strategic roguelike game where you build a troop list for battles. You will take on the role of the Divine Chosen One, assembling and leading your army to explore various islands. Through careful troop deployment, you engage in battles against enemies. By using the skills of the Divine Chosen One and simple operations on the army, you strive to defeat the foes. After passing different islands, you'll receive various rewards. It could be an upgrade to your troops, the liberation and incorporation of imprisoned slaves into your army, or the rich treasures hidden under the Italian divine secrets. Ultimately, you'll battle against the evil High Priest to achieve the final victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Forks in the Road</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the islands are shrouded in mist. Only the islands you've visited reveal the surrounding conditions. When you encounter a fork in the road, which path leads to the island of the Mad Priest? If you choose the wrong on